{"audit_run_id":"audit:9f3a10f97fe04093bf47b9f27fdf1cab","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":93,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"`quail_flooring.csv` — 48 data rows plus one header row, comma separated, no missing values."},{"end_column":99,"end_line":9,"start_column":1,"start_line":9,"text":"One row is **one Japanese quail chick**. Each chick was housed on its own from hatch to 21 days of"},{"end_column":94,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"age, reared on one of the two brooder floor types, and measured once at the end of the 21-day"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"rearing period. Every chick contributes exactly one row and has a value for all six outcomes, so"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"there are 48 rows for the 48 chicks: 24 on plastic mesh flooring and 24 on chopped straw litter."},{"end_column":39,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| Column | Type | Unit | Description |"},{"end_column":26,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| --- | --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":92,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `chick_id` | text | — | Per-chick identifier, `q01` through `q48`. Unique, one per row. |"},{"end_column":178,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `floor_type` | text | — | Brooder floor the chick was reared on. Exactly two values: `mesh` (plastic mesh flooring, 24 chicks) and `straw` (chopped straw litter, 24 chicks). |"},{"end_column":66,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| `body_weight_g` | number | g | Body weight at 21 days of age. |"},{"end_column":98,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"| `feed_intake_g_d` | number | g/day | Average daily feed intake over the whole rearing period. |"},{"end_column":172,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"| `footpad_score_pts` | integer | points | Foot-pad lesion score at 21 days on a 0 to 4 scale, where 0 is no visible lesion and 4 is the most severe. Whole numbers only. |"},{"end_column":73,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"| `tibia_strength_n` | number | N | Tibia breaking strength (newtons). |"},{"end_column":110,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"| `corticosterone_ng_ml` | number | ng/mL | Plasma corticosterone concentration. Right-skewed across birds. |"},{"end_column":135,"end_line":25,"start_column":1,"start_line":25,"text":"| `tonic_immobility_s` | number | s | Duration of tonic immobility (seconds), a behavioural fear measure. Right-skewed across birds. |"},{"end_column":98,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"The six outcome columns appear in the order the trial declared them in advance: body weight, feed"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"intake, foot-pad lesion score, tibia breaking strength, plasma corticosterone, tonic immobility."},{"end_column":31,"end_line":32,"start_column":1,"start_line":32,"text":"| Column | Minimum | Maximum |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":33,"start_column":1,"start_line":33,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":35,"end_line":34,"start_column":1,"start_line":34,"text":"| `body_weight_g` | 76.3 | 108.3 |"},{"end_column":37,"end_line":35,"start_column":1,"start_line":35,"text":"| `feed_intake_g_d` | 9.94 | 14.31 |"},{"end_column":32,"end_line":36,"start_column":1,"start_line":36,"text":"| `footpad_score_pts` | 0 | 4 |"},{"end_column":37,"end_line":37,"start_column":1,"start_line":37,"text":"| `tibia_strength_n` | 18.2 | 37.8 |"},{"end_column":41,"end_line":38,"start_column":1,"start_line":38,"text":"| `corticosterone_ng_ml` | 2.15 | 9.26 |"},{"end_column":36,"end_line":39,"start_column":1,"start_line":39,"text":"| `tonic_immobility_s` | 42 | 251 |"}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:594f0d2c6cc8f4e14a69","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:551530d2d494988b2e7b7e74ab80e933b865c8aad407f9e9f8646ff20879b2c6","end_line":39,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-39","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:9f3a10f97fe04093bf47b9f27fdf1cab","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":96,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `floor_type` column of `quail_flooring.csv`."},{"end_column":169,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: body_weight_g, feed_intake_g_d, footpad_score_pts, tibia_strength_n, corticosterone_ng_ml, tonic_immobility_s."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:86e736bb682eb15109f8","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:85442328b40131ac6f428d83ab1d15519c8bf605d6c0c312ab7ce21d2bdb2675","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
